; A read-only TC=16 loop with two early exits in an infinite outer loop (from
; LLVM's PressureDiff::addPressureChange). Base: GVN removes the loads of %this
; and in @is_valid, redundant across iterations. Deferred: after the late
; unroll the redundant loads, guarded by the early exits, are kept. Fix: GVN
; after the late unroll, or peeling (LoopPeel's
